ibkr-cli is an independent Go implementation of a client for the
Interactive Brokers Client Portal Web API 1.0:

    IBKR Web API documentation — https://www.interactivebrokers.com/campus/ibkr-api-page/cpapi-v1/
    IBind (endpoint coverage and OAuth 1.0a reference implementation) — https://github.com/Voyz/ibind
    Copyright (c) Voyz and the IBind contributors
    Licensed under the MIT License
    IBeam (gateway session maintenance) — https://github.com/Voyz/ibeam

The endpoint paths, parameter names, snapshot field codes, and the
OAuth 1.0a variant flow implemented here follow the official IBKR Web
API documentation and were cross-checked against IBind. The live
session token cryptography in internal/auth/oauth1a.go is a Go port of
IBind's implementation (same algorithms, verified byte-for-byte
against vectors generated by IBind). This project is not affiliated
with or endorsed by Interactive Brokers, the IBind project, or the
IBeam project.
